    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend your computer from incoming viruses using powerful turrets!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Tower Defense for Virus</i> is a tower defense game with rogue-lite elements. Strategically place your turrets to quickly eliminate waves of viruses and protect your system from the ever-growing threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stage is set inside a PC! Viruses of all kinds are advancing from different directions toward the system. From regular viruses to fast-moving worms, and even malware that displays malicious ads!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357880/extras/23e2071a84d33d97f278480a50eafed5.poster.avif?t=1733915387\" width=800 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357880/extras/23e2071a84d33d97f278480a50eafed5.webm?t=1733915387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357880/extras/23e2071a84d33d97f278480a50eafed5.mp4?t=1733915387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must choose which turrets to deploy and where to place them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you defend the system from the incoming virus threats?</p>",
